OL,3,C'Significant' grass fire prompts
OL,4,Ccigarette and glass bottle warning
OL,6,FFirefighters in Guernsey remain at the
OL,7,Fsite of a 'significant' grass fire at
OL,8,Fthe Fontaine Vinery near Vale Road.
OL,10,FThe cause of the blaze is not yet
OL,11,Fknown and no injuries were reported.
OL,13,FGuernsey Fire and Rescue Service says
OL,14,Fit has now been extinguished but crews
OL,15,Fare still dampening down areas of
OL,16,Fvegetation and will continue to
OL,17,Fmonitor developments closely for the
OL,18,Frest of the evening.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G1/5
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
