OL,24,ANext Page BCh Is News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,357,350,120,260,000,100
PN,35603
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F356A1786121303
OL,3,C'Significant' grass fire prompts
OL,4,Ccigarette and glass bottle warning
OL,6,FSpeaking to ITV News, Jonathan
OL,7,FHalford, Assistant Chief Fire Officer
OL,8,Ffor Guernsey Fire and Rescue Service,
OL,9,Fsaid: "There's quite a significant
OL,10,Famount of smoke so the first thing
OL,11,Fwe'd like to do is to reassure
OL,12,Fresidents that we're dealing with the
OL,13,Fincident and just to reassure them
OL,14,Fthat if they've got windows and doors
OL,15,Fopen, and they're feeling the effects
OL,16,Fof the smoke, to please make sure that
OL,17,Fthey close their windows and doors for
OL,18,Fsafety purposes."
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G3/5
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BCh Is News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,357,350,120,260,000,100
PN,35604
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F356A1786121303
OL,3,C'Significant' grass fire prompts
OL,4,Ccigarette and glass bottle warning
OL,6,FMr Halford added: "While it's very
OL,7,Fdry, we've had very little rain, we
OL,8,Furge the public not to drop and
OL,9,Fdiscard cigarettes. We also remind the
OL,10,Fpublic about dropping things like
OL,11,Fglass bottles because they can refract
OL,12,Fthe light and they can start fires in
OL,13,Fthe same way that we'd like to remind
OL,14,Fpeople about the safe use of bonfires
OL,15,Fand burning items in their gardens, as
OL,16,Fwell as the use of portable and
OL,17,Fdisposable barbecues.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G4/5
