CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F356A1786121303
OL,3,C'Significant' grass fire prompts
OL,4,Ccigarette and glass bottle warning
OL,6,F"Inherently, when we have dry weather,
OL,7,Fwhile they're (generally) used very
OL,8,Fsafely, they can cause fires to spread
OL,9,Fvery quickly."
